<title>UK: UK issues further 200 mln stg in bond tranches.</title>
<headline>UK issues further 200 mln stg in bond tranches.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain has issued a 200 million stg tranche of 2.5 percent index-linked Treasury stock due 2013, the Bank of England said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The striking price is 146.18 and 90 million stg had been sold in tender by 0955 GMT, the Bank said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
